        "@value": "**DEPRECATED in SPDX 3.1.**\nUse [/Core/isoAutomationLevel](../../Core/Properties/isoAutomationLevel.md)\ninstead.\n\nIndicates whether the system can perform a decision or action without human\ninvolvement or guidance."
      }
    ],
